OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham should back EU
OL,4,Amembership now, says Plaid MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlaid Cymru's leader in Westminster
OL,7,Fsays Andy Burnham should back rejoining
OL,8,Fthe EU now, and not delay his decision
OL,9,Funtil the next general election.
OL,11,FThe prime minister has said it is
OL,12,F"possible" that a future Labour
OL,13,Felection manifesto could promise a new
OL,14,Fin-out referendum on the European
OL,15,FUnion.
OL,17,FLiz Saville Roberts said she would
OL,18,Fwelcome any commitment by Burnham to
OL,19,Freverse Brexit, claiming Wales would be
OL,20,Fbetter off in the political and
OL,21,Feconomic bloc.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
